  tool: 3
  instructions: Three stations demonstrate grid, slope props and seeded scatter.
    Select START HERE and open Scene Placement. Existing examples are saved reference
    objects. The green tool preview shows your next group. Change origin to the station
    shown in its name.
  challenge: Grid origin (-18,0,0), count 9, columns 3. Surface origin (0,0,0), count
    9, columns 3. Scatter origin (18,0,0), count 36, width 16, seed 42. Compare spacing
    1/2 m and slope limit 15/45 degrees. Undo each created group before the next
    surface trial.
